<title>MALTA: Malta indicative money market rates.</title>
<headline>Malta indicative money market rates.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indicative money market rates were unchanged at the beginning of the week in Malta.</p>
<p>The Malta Central Bank said the weekly reverse repo (absorption) rate was 5.0 percent and the weighted average yield bills was 4.996 (one month), 4.997 (three months), 5.290 (six months) and 5.360, one year.</p>
<p>The Central Bank discount rate is 5.5 percent.</p>
</text>
